  "description": "# SIP2.40: Add 3 Arks to LazyVault_HigherRisk_WETH Fleet on mainnet\n\n## Summary\nThis is a cross-chain governance proposal to add 3 new Ark(s) to the existing LazyVault_HigherRisk_WETH Fleet on mainnet.\n\n## Motivation\nExpanding this fleet with additional Arks will enhance the protocol's capabilities on mainnet.\n\n## Technical Details\n- Hub Chain: base (Production)\n- Target Chain: mainnet\n- Fleet Commander: 0x2E6abcbCCeD9Af05bc3B8a4908e0c98c29A88e10\n- Number of Arks to add: 3\n\n## New Ark Addresses\n1. `0xD33E132C34c978C18ACd8CD90D14467C1BF10f30`\n2. `0xc41AF022a0cBBbD95b4A4Eb5B9EbB51bB888bB0D`\n3. `0xa3B8e720cFff63fd47Ea80e18b773965E25c2b6c`\n\n## Specifications\n### Actions\nThis proposal will execute the following actions on mainnet:\n1. Grant COMMANDER_ROLE to Fleet Commander for each Ark\n2. Add each Ark to the Fleet Commander\n\n### Cross-chain Mechanism\nThis proposal uses LayerZero to execute governance actions across chains.\n\n## References\nDiscourse: https://forum.summer.fi/t/sip2-40-onboard-eth-aave-compound-spark-to-the-mainnet-higher-risk-eth-fleet/479\n",
